{"id":"n43785-1-9","stage":1,"title":"뜻 · 意","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n43785-1-9-1","ko":"한국어를 읽을 줄은 아는데 말의 뜻이 뭔지 잘 모르겠어요.","zh":"我会读韩语，但不太明白这些词的意思。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"한국어를","meaning":"韩国语，韩语","explanation":"한국어：韩国语，韩语；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한국어","audio":"/audio/ea3252281bc3bcec5672.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26910","senseId":"1","lemma":"한국어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한국어를","audio":"/audio/5ceaa932f63f4a694c6f.mp3"}},{"text":"읽을","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"읽을","audio":"/audio/f8f8e5d4d8501ba2e035.mp3"}},{"text":"줄은","meaning":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","explanation":"줄：表示某个方法或实际内容等；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"줄","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91870","senseId":"1","lemma":"줄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄은","audio":"/audio/6c741f34f1d3bba22b58.mp3"}},{"text":"아는데","meaning":"会，能","explanation":"알다：会，能；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"5","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아는데","audio":"/audio/ee8c9b71b390646a7b6a.mp3"}},{"text":"말의","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말의","audio":"/audio/27659215f70ba94cc716.mp3"}},{"text":"뜻이","meaning":"意，意思","explanation":"뜻：意，意思；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뜻","audio":"/audio/883d841ce6a33cf78194.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43785","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜻","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뜻이","audio":"/audio/848ad8a59107ad50ec30.mp3"}},{"text":"뭔지","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭔지","audio":"/audio/f1fa2ef3977aec58566d.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地。","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어요.","meaning":"不会，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不会，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"2","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모르겠어요","audio":"/audio/262161281aabff06df61.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ea3252281bc3bcec","term":"한국어","zh":"韩国语，韩语","audio":"/audio/ea3252281bc3bcec5672.mp3","entryId":"26910","definition":"韩国使用的语言。","pronunciation":["한ː구거"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]},{"id":"4e04e3938cc9c67e","term":"줄","zh":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","audio":"/audio/4e04e3938cc9c67ed71b.mp3","entryId":"91870","definition":"表示某个方法或实际内容等。","pronunciation":["줄"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"会，能","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"具有能做某事的能力或技术。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"883d841ce6a33cf7","term":